sentences.text:
Learned counsel for the applicant submitted that applicant is innocent and has been falsely implicated in the present case; instant F.I.R. has been lodged on account of some monetary dispute;
the statement of victim recorded under Sections 161 Cr.P.C. and 164 Cr.P.C. and the medical report are not supporting the prosecution case; the victim has refused for internal medical examination;
there is no evidence to prosecute the applicant in the present case.
